# 04 Results: displacement delivery ratio

Generated by `analysis.py`. Ratio = Theil–Sen slope of delivered (FK of /joint_states, along the commanded direction, lag removed) vs commanded (integrated /servo_node/delta_twist_cmds) path per stroke, path-weighted over strokes. Twist frames seen: base_link.

**Excluded:**

- `V1/V1_90_Degrees_Forwards`: arm did not follow: delivered 1.9 % of the commanded path (lookahead setting: [])
- `V1/V1_90_Degrees_Twist`: arm did not follow: delivered 1.7 % of the commanded path (lookahead setting: [])
- `SIM_latency/B_look10`: arm did not follow: delivered 0.0 % of the commanded path (lookahead setting: ['SERVO_LOOKAHEAD=0.01'])

